+// Port fixes: game files (and memory patches) the port applies on every boot,
+// laid out like a mod in <game root>/fixes/ -- a `files/` tree and/or a
+// patches.txt. They are made from the player's own disc when the game is
+// built, so nothing disc-derived ships, and they restore or repair what the
+// GameCube release left out (the Sketch Artist's voice page, for one). Never
+// listed in MODS or switched off there; a mod replacing the same file wins.
+// They count for netplay like any game-file mod.
+inline constexpr char kPortFixesName[] = "<port fixes>";
